# Optional. A free Socrata App Token raises the rate limit on datos.gov.co.
# Get one: https://www.datos.gov.co -> Sign up -> your profile -> "Developer Settings" -> "Create new App Token".
# Without it the API still works, but throttled per IP. See README "Socrata App Token".
SOCRATA_APP_TOKEN=

